WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.830
You’ve probably come across a leadership framework or two.

2
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.290
Remembering how it works when you actually need it?
That’s the hard part.

3
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:13.640
Pivot Labs starts with what’s going on for you,
like having too much on your plate.

4
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:18.770
Answer a question or two, and it points you
to a tool that fits, with the reason why.

5
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.910
Fill it in with your own work,
one plain question at a time.

6
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.500
Then you leave with a plan.

7
00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:35.540
Print it, save a picture of it,
or take it into your next conversation.

8
00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.810
There’s more to explore, and the list keeps growing.

9
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.610
No account, no login, and it all runs in your browser.

10
00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:46.870
Pivot Labs. Navigating everyday leadership.

11
00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.830
Find it at pivotlabsleadership.com.

